*{{cite book|author1=Harold P. Zelko|author2=Frank E. X. Dance|title=Business and professional speech communication|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=sKFZAAAAYAAJ|access-date=30 May 2013|year=1978|publisher=Holt, Rinehart and Winston|isbn=9780030188916}}
*{{cite book|author=Frank E. X. Dance|title=Human Communication Theory: Comparative Essays|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=bbB-AAAAMAAJ|access-date=30 May 2013|date=1 January 1982|publisher=Harper & Row|isbn=978-0-06-041481-8}}
